WEBVTT

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.290
Damn, it took off with my right arm.

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:19.400
Isuka! Kosagi! Tobi!

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:22.760
Kosagi, status report.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:28.140
The coordinates that Atori and Karasu
jumped to are slightly off.

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:30.780
I can't confirm Fukuro's position.

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:32.350
Kuina, your arm...

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:35.210
Never mind the arm.
I lost the communicator too.

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:38.290
Tobi, mark this
dimensional time and space.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:39.680
Understood.

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:53.000
This dimension is wavering.

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:05.730
At the silver sky, the endless sky

00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:12.060
I gazed together with you, without a word

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:18.240
Touching your back, with trembling fingers

00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:23.670
I quietly ponder, as your profile looks up

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:29.710
I want to assure your smile, and the future ahead of you

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:29.840
Just standing and crying, I want to erase myself away
I want to assure your smile, and the future ahead of you

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:36.050
Just standing and crying, I want to erase myself away

00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:36.180
As I extend my hands, it is almost within my reach
Just standing and crying, I want to erase myself away

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:41.930
As I extend my hands, it is almost within my reach

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:42.060
This is no fantasy, possibilities are perhaps right by my side
As I extend my hands, it is almost within my reach

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:47.980
This is no fantasy, possibilities are perhaps right by my side

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:48.110
Changing every sorrow into strength
This is no fantasy, possibilities are perhaps right by my side

00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:53.820
Changing every sorrow into strength

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:53.950
Let's throw all limitations into the end of time
Changing every sorrow into strength

00:01:53.950 --> 00:01:59.990
Let's throw all limitations into the end of time

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:03.180
Just keeping you as my aspirations

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:08.330
Even in the driving wind

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:15.270
I'll still be pushing on ahead

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:20.930
Misekku kesta

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:28.850
Fortune. Will you save it for me, dear?

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:38.570
You can't do it.

00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:41.270
You can't possibly save that girl.

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:44.880
Who are you?

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:47.020
I am...

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:49.560
...you!

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:51.650
Yuu!

00:02:52.090 --> 00:02:52.990
Ignore him!

00:02:52.990 --> 00:02:53.860
What?

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:58.020
I...

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:00.370
I know you.

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:05.560
I know about you.

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:12.740
Hmm...

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:15.090
So, the Dragon Torque is a human.

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:17.310
Atori.

00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:31.420
I found it first, Karasu.

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:35.530
I found the Dragon Torque!

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:37.690
Dragon Torque?

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.170
I'll transport her.

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:42.140
Wait, Atori.

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:44.170
There's a chance the Dragon Torque

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:47.040
may be unable
to withstand the shock of transposition.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:49.410
Even an arm would be enough.

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:54.840
If I just take a piece
of her back with me...

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:08.180
We can't do that yet.

00:04:09.070 --> 00:04:12.570
Gonna try to monopolize
all the glory again, Karasu?

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:16.190
Don't act on your own until we
establish contact with Kuina.

00:04:37.490 --> 00:04:41.340
Entropic phenomenon is increasing!
The dimension is starting to waver!

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:42.630
What caused it?!

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:45.340
I believe it's the effect of
a hyper spin stimulant reaction!

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:50.100
Spin weaponry was deployed
in this dimension?!

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:53.850
If it isn't stopped, it will
trigger a causation violation!

00:04:56.680 --> 00:04:59.470
The flow of time is
starting to decelerate.

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:08.700
What?

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:13.130
Time has stopped.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.430
Damn.

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:29.310
You have to stop. It's triggering
a dimensional resonance phase.

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:33.510
Karasu, I hate you.

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:35.750
Were you aware of that?

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:37.940
If you were to simply disappear,
I could simply claim...

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:41.360
that you were flung somewhere in
time and space during a mission...

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:45.860
And no one would think it strange, I'm sure.

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:02.420
Karasu... I know him.

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:19.860
I won't hold back this time.

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:34.990
What are you doing?! Is this the time
to be fighting amongst yourselves?!

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:36.950
Damn.

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:38.980
Fukuro, so you're okay?

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:41.250
There was an error in
the transposition coordinates.

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:44.480
So, did you locate the Dragon Torque?

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:46.010
Yes.

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:58.490
That... is the Dragon Torque?

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:05.240
Not yet! It won't stabilize!
We're being recalled!

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:06.740
Anti-shock protection!

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:21.280
They're gone... Haruka!

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:26.480
Haruka! Where are they?!
Where did they go?

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:28.840
He vanished.

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:31.930
He vanished again.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:36.870
- Hey!
- Where are you?

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:38.770
- Haruka! Yuu!
- Where are you guys?

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:40.850
Haruka, where are you?

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:44.980
Thank goodness.

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:47.180
Are you okay? Nothing happened?

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:49.720
Where's the ghost? You saw the entrance
to the spirit world, didn't you?

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:51.660
Miho, you keep quiet!

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:53.220
What? But why?

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:55.220
All I'm saying is you'll confuse things!

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:56.660
But that was a spirit, wasn't it?

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:59.160
Geez, what's she saying now?

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:02.350
If it were an alien,
it would take out our insides.

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:05.630
Yuu, did something happen?

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:07.390
Yuu!

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:11.570
It's nothing. I'm fine.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.880
<i>Unit stationing complete.</i>

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:53.770
Looks like we made it back.

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:56.420
Kuina!

00:08:57.220 --> 00:09:01.860
<i>One unit is damaged.
Requesting medical team.</i>

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:15.370
The birds' dimensional transposition
Seems far from being stabilized.

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:18.940
The probability of success is
increasing. There's no need to worry.

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:22.270
However, only seven birds remain.

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:27.710
It is possible to secure
the Dragon Torque with only one bird.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:31.390
Besides, birds that observed
have survived.

00:09:31.390 --> 00:09:36.090
So, there is no waver in the dimension
where the Dragon Torque exists?

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:39.850
Its existence is definite. There is no mistake.

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:43.000
If we can only obtain the Dragon Torque...

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:45.670
we can prevent Shangri-la
from corroding our civilization.

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:49.000
Can the Dragon Torque really be captured?

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:50.870
If we fail...

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:55.190
Our dimension, La'cryma
will be obliterated.

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:08.920
That dimension is going back
15 years on the time axis.

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:13.260
And it's a world that is
approximate to ours...

00:10:13.260 --> 00:10:16.470
where everything is similar
to our own past.

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:25.110
A dimension where you, I...

00:10:25.110 --> 00:10:27.730
and she exist.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:31.570
It's ironic.

00:10:32.180 --> 00:10:34.580
All we have to do is fulfill our roles.

00:10:35.890 --> 00:10:38.740
Stabilize the dimension
under the social order of Reizu.

00:10:39.520 --> 00:10:41.120
That's our duty as dragon knights.

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:42.490
Stop it, Karasu!

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:47.730
We won't be ruled by anyone again.

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:50.210
There's no need to bear
the responsibility either.

00:10:50.770 --> 00:10:52.710
Then why?

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:56.870
Good question.

00:10:56.870 --> 00:11:01.530
Maybe I just want to be able to
dream again like I did in the old days.

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:17.120
What was all that?

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:21.790
Have I gone crazy?

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:25.830
Still...

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.760
That was no dream.

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:47.660
Yuu?

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:49.080
I'm done.

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:03.910
Hey, wait up, Haruka!

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:06.040
No way! We'll be late!

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:09.810
What are you talking about?!
It's your own fault for sleeping in!

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:11.810
I'm sorry! I forgot about that!

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:13.780
All right, so wait up!

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:17.020
- No can do!
- For crying out loud, you run as fast as a dog!

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:18.120
I'm not a dog!

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:19.810
I know that!

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:31.270
You okay, Ai?

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:34.230
No... I think I'm gonna die.

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:36.430
I'm dead.

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:40.280
Hey, don't damage it!

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:42.870
Yukie-chan...

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:45.310
Uh, oh. The roof is dented.

00:12:45.310 --> 00:12:46.160
No way!

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:50.870
Ghost?

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:53.380
That's amazing.

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:55.720
You don't believe us, do you?

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:57.160
Of course I believe you.

00:12:57.160 --> 00:12:58.850
Don't talk with your mouth full.

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:03.700
That was definitely the real thing.
We finally saw one. Right?

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:08.390
Yeah... Fujiwara was freaking out
that it grabbed his leg.

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:11.270
Impossible.

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:12.570
Oh?

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:16.210
But I think you should stop going
out at night all by yourselves.

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:17.710
We're fine.

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:19.380
That's true, because we're fast runners.

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:21.030
That's not the point.

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:25.490
Now that you mention it,
I heard a similar rumor.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:26.460
You're kidding.

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:29.060
Really? Yukie-chan, please tell me!

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:33.000
Apparently my mom heard it
from a lady in the neighborhood...

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:36.630
One appeared in Hachibanzaka.

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:39.630
A spirit with only one arm!

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.170
Only one arm?

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:42.910
That's similar to the one we saw.

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:46.640
Amazing! The town
is overflowing with ghosts!

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:48.380
Wow! That means there's a chance...

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:51.150
- Hey...
...we can meet one again!

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:53.100
I'm so excited! I can hardly wait!

00:14:00.890 --> 00:14:03.290
I want you to go
straight to crammer today.

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:04.930
I know.

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:07.370
I know only you can be accepted
by the school.

00:14:08.100 --> 00:14:10.330
Don't worry. You're smart enough...

00:14:10.330 --> 00:14:13.300
- I...
...to get into Tokyo University for sure.

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:15.700
I don't want to do exams.

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:17.870
I don't want to go to Tokyo either.

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:20.630
I'll decide my own future.

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:26.380
What are you talking about?
It's impossible for you to do that.

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:30.820
You can't do it. You can't.

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:37.600
Yuu, I'm the one who knows
what's best for you...

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:39.360
No, you don't!

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:16.350
Yuu?

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:20.400
Yuu!

00:15:20.860 --> 00:15:24.670
Wait up! Hey, what's
with the get-up?

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.610
Planning to run away
from home or something?

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:31.820
Yeah, as if! It's for study camp, right?
Man, how lame is that!

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:35.080
You put on a headband
with Victory written on it, and chant...

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:37.950
"I'll study! I'll succeed!"

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:42.120
"Study! Success! Study! Success!"

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.690
I...

00:15:45.990 --> 00:15:47.860
Quit going to cram school.

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:51.470
You're gonna break down if
you continue on like this.

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:59.870
Let's start playing soccer together again.
You were on the team last year.

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:05.680
I... don't have your ability.

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:15.390
You don't have to take it so seriously!
Just enjoy it, that's all.

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:17.950
You wouldn't understand anyway!

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:20.260
Wait!

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:21.360
Shut up!

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:22.920
Why, you!

00:16:23.590 --> 00:16:26.510
Are you gonna do everything
your mother tells you, Momma's Boy?!

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:28.900
You're wrong! I'm not like that!

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:31.090
Tell me how I'm wrong!

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:33.240
- Someone like you wouldn't understand!
- Fujiwara?

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:34.640
- Yuu!
- What did you say?!

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:35.980
Hey, you guys!

00:16:35.980 --> 00:16:38.350
Stop it! What are you doing?!

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:40.060
Cut it out, Fujiwara!

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:42.600
Yuu, are you okay?

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:47.060
Damn, there's something wrong with you!

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:49.290
Fujiwara!

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:54.750
What's he thinking?

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:03.400
That backpack... Are you
running away from home, Yuu?

00:17:05.610 --> 00:17:07.080
Don't follow me.

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:10.340
But I said that if we ran away
we would run away together.

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:13.340
You have no reason to run away!

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:16.750
Sure, maybe your dad
doesn't live with you...

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:19.480
but your mother trusts you, doesn't she?

00:17:19.860 --> 00:17:23.420
Your father cares about you, doesn't he?

00:17:25.090 --> 00:17:27.480
It's different in my house.
It's all fallen apart.

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:32.100
Even when it comes to my well-being,
she talks like she cares...

00:17:32.100 --> 00:17:33.700
but inside she doesn't.

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:36.040
That's not true.

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:39.510
Liar. You know it's true.

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:42.710
I'll go with you.

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:46.880
We made a promise to
run away from home together.

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:50.280
Let's go to where you
want to go together.

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:17.510
Geez, what are we doing here?

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:21.500
After all, if we're running away,
we won't be coming back for a while.

00:18:22.350 --> 00:18:24.180
So, we're here for
one last look at the town.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:26.990
Be careful now.

00:18:26.990 --> 00:18:28.500
Okay!

00:18:31.930 --> 00:18:33.510
Hey, over here!

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:38.230
Oh, come on... Hurry up!

00:18:38.770 --> 00:18:42.100
It's really high up, you should see it!

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:43.070
Really?

00:18:43.070 --> 00:18:45.040
Yeah! The cars look like ants!

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:46.810
Really? I wanna see that!

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:47.650
Yeah!

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:50.370
One last look...

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:31.310
He's gone.

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:33.790
Now what?

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:35.720
Let's stay here tonight.

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:37.290
What? Here?

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:39.660
Why not? We've run away from home.

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:41.360
But still...

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:44.230
You know, I'm feeling kind of tired.

00:19:44.730 --> 00:19:46.420
I'm borrowing this.

00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:49.570
You're crazy.

00:19:56.910 --> 00:19:59.550
What happened yesterday
wasn't a dream, right?

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:04.110
You saw him too, didn't you?

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:11.550
That wasn't a ghost. It was different.

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:14.400
Yuu?

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:17.060
He made a fool out of me!

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:20.410
He said I couldn't do anything.

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:23.700
You can't do it. You can't.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:28.040
Yuu...

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.520
I hear something.

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:49.160
Someone...

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:51.940
- Yuu!
- Someone... Someone's here.

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:57.560
Wha... What?

00:20:58.840 --> 00:21:00.530
What is this?!

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:12.850
What the hell? This can't be right!

00:21:12.850 --> 00:21:14.210
Do you see them too?

00:21:14.420 --> 00:21:16.830
Yeah, I see lots of people.

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:18.710
Hurry up!

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:24.220
That's the boy we saw when we got here.

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:27.270
Hey, over here!

00:21:32.840 --> 00:21:34.940
Th... This can't be happening.

00:21:35.380 --> 00:21:37.350
We're seeing an evening mirage.

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:40.670
That is neither a mirage nor an illusion.

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:43.860
It is dimensional resonance.

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:44.950
Who's there?

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:47.750
The past and the future
have not separated.

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:50.390
Similar to an Uroboros.

00:21:50.390 --> 00:21:51.560
What do you mean?

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:52.870
What's wrong, Haruka?

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:56.330
The beginning passes through the ending...

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:58.370
to once again become the beginning.

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:02.440
In order to exist...

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:06.240
you must find the one who will
become the absolute observer...

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:08.410
What? I can't hear you!

00:22:11.210 --> 00:22:12.890
Yuu?

00:22:30.500 --> 00:22:32.410
Tobi, are you all right?

00:22:32.410 --> 00:22:33.690
Yeah.

